                                "example_id": "2889f55d-1fa7-47fa-a6af-4d6507819013",
                                "sense_id": "a0be49de-409c-36b9-bb6f-8ddcc92f0790",
                                "text": "[W]hen good and faire in one Perſon meet, argues both a groſſe and ſhallow Judgement, and withall an ungentle, and ſwainiſh breſt."
                            },
                            {
